name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q11_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'A student posts publicly on social media about their hobbies, school, neighborhood, and daily routines. How might an AI system use this information in ways the student didn\'t expect?'

wrong 'AI systems cannot access publicly posted social media data.'
wrong 'The AI would only use this data to recommend better social media posts.'
right 'An AI could combine these details to build a detailed profile of the student, even if none of the pieces seemed private on their own.'
wrong 'Sharing information publicly on social media means it can never be used by AI.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

